# RepoLens persistent embedding cache
# Default location is ~/.cache/repolens/ (outside any repository), so it is
# inherently untracked. These patterns guard against a REPOLENS_CACHE_DIR
# override pointing into a repository.
.repolens-cache/
**/.repolens-cache/
.repolens_embeddings/
**/.repolens_embeddings/

# Real-world benchmark data (external repository downloads)
.benchmark_data/